text.section:
To establish a protected series, a limited liability company shall deliver to the Commission for filing a statement of protected series designation setting forth:

The name of the limited liability company;


The name of the protected series being established;


The post office address of the principal office of the protected series; and


A statement that the establishment of the protected series was approved by the affirmative vote or consent of all members of the limited liability company.

To amend a statement of protected series designation, a series limited liability company shall deliver to the Commission for filing a statement of designation change setting forth:

The name of the series limited liability company;


The name of the protected series to which the designation change applies;


The text of each change to the statement of protected series designation; and


A statement that the amendment was approved by the affirmative vote or consent of all members of the series limited liability company.
